cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "6D Foraging Methodology: Strategic Dimensional Discovery"
message: "If you use this methodology, please cite it using the metadata from this file."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Shatny
    given-names: Michael
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0006-2011-3258"
repository-code: "https://github.com/semanticintent/6d-foraging-methodology"
url: "https://6d.cormorantforaging.dev"
doi: "10.5281/zenodo.18209946"
abstract: >-
  The 6D Foraging Methodology is a strategic analysis framework 
  that maps how problems cascade across six business dimensions 
  (Customer, Employee, Revenue, Regulatory, Quality, Operational). 
  Using a 3D scoring lens (Sound/Space/Time), it reveals cost 
  multipliers of 2-11× that traditional analysis misses.
keywords:
  - strategic analysis
  - cascade analysis
  - cost multiplier
  - business dimensions
  - risk assessment
  - 6D methodology
  - foraging methodology
